## 비전

**열처리 산업 Quality Management Platform** · NDK 전용 ❌

**Develop Once, Deploy Anywhere**

One Core · Multiple Editions · Multiple Repositories · One Quality Platform

---

## Platform Layers

```text
TITAN Core Platform
  UI · Workflow · Print · Document · Certificate · QR · History · Statistics · Dashboard
Edition Layer
  Standalone · MES Connected · Enterprise (Future)
Repository Layer
  Session · SQLite · Oracle · API · CSV · Future
Data Source Layer
  Session · SQLite · Oracle · REST API · CSV · Future ERP/MES
```

**Core는 MES·DB 비종속** · **Repository만 Data Source 호출**

---

## Edition

| Edition | 용도 | Repository |
|---------|------|------------|
| **Standalone** | MES 없음 · TITAN 전체 관리 | Session → SQLite |
| **MES Connected** | MES SoT · TITAN QMS · Read Only | Oracle / API / CSV |
| **Enterprise** | Smart Factory (Future) | MES·ERP·PLC·IoT·AI·SPC |

